Changelog: 21-11-2026 00:56:48

Release 1.5.0.

Changelog: 21-11-2026 00:38:50

Added. A quickfix VRM Sensors (bc250-quickfix vrm; owner, 21-11-2026: a Quickfix item beside Sensors Module). It builds
the bc250_vrm kernel module for the running kernel and loads it, now and at every boot, through a service of its own
(bc250-quickfix-vrm.service); a new kernel gets its own build at its first boot. The module's source comes with the
app, unchanged, from Hexxeh/bc250-vrm-dkms v1.1.0 (GPL-2.0), with a Kbuild of our own: upstream's Makefile names
clang, and Bazzite's kernel is built with gcc. Turn off unloads the module and removes the service and its folder,
/var/lib/bc250-quickfix/vrm.

